      "clinical-constellation": "a named pattern of multiple findings; incomplete patterns can still be clinically important and the label is not a single maneuver",
      "named-clinical-test": "a named clinical test interpreted from a defined method and response; it is not interchangeable with the associated disorder",
      "imaging-sign": "an imaging pattern interpreted within a complete study; it is not a bedside physical sign",
